 ['civic','Civic (identity reference)','reference','An identity credential or application-access check is not a complete AML monitoring service. For an existing Civic-based integration, specify the credential, issuing party, information collected and revocation behavior. Evaluate its role separately from customer due diligence, transaction screening and reporting.','Confirm the exact current product and support route before planning a new integration; a historical credential reference is not a procurement specification.','https://www.civic.com/'],
 ['chainalysis-vasp-directory','Chainalysis VASP Risking','analytics','Chainalysis VASP Risking provides counterparty profiles and risk information for virtual asset service providers. This is a product record within the Chainalysis family, not an additional independent company. A profile supports due diligence but does not substitute for checking the legal entity and permissions.','Inspect profile sources, update timing, watchlist alerts, entity matching and the evidence used to approve a counterparty relationship.','https://www.chainalysis.com/product/vasp-risking/'],
 ['hummingbird','Hummingbird','operations','Hummingbird describes unified risk and compliance operations, including investigation and case workflows. Consider it where analysts need to assemble information, collaborate, document decisions and manage reporting. The workflow depends on the quality and availability of the connected data sources.','Demonstrate case assignment, linked evidence, reviewer approval, reporting outputs and complete exports when a case or supplier relationship closes.','https://www.hummingbird.co/'],
 ['flagright','Flagright','operations','Flagright describes transaction monitoring, screening, risk scoring and financial-crime workflows. Compare rule configuration, case handling and integration under your own operating model. An automated alert or suggested disposition is not a substitute for an accountable compliance decision.','Test rule versioning, case evidence, approval controls, monitoring delays and how an analyst can explain and reverse an incorrect disposition.','https://www.flagright.com/'],
 ['elliptic-lens','Elliptic Lens','analytics','Lens is an Elliptic screening product, not a separate company. Compare wallet and transaction checks under the selected configuration, including the assets, networks and risk categories needed by your business. A screening result needs interpretation alongside customer and transaction context.','Ask for an explainable result, exposure path, timestamps, monitoring scope and the record preserved when labels or policies later change.','https://www.elliptic.co/products/lens/'],
 ['refinitiv-world-check-lseg','LSEG World-Check','identity operations','LSEG World-Check supplies structured risk intelligence for screening individuals and organizations, including sanctions, politically exposed persons and adverse media. World-Check data, World-Check One workflows and embedded APIs are distinct delivery options. This is not a blockchain transaction-tracing product.','Test name matching with secondary identifiers, source evidence, ongoing screening, case review and the required data-retention model.','https://www.lseg.com/en/risk-intelligence/screening-solutions/world-check-kyc-screening'],
 ['persona','Persona','identity operations','Persona describes identity operations with verification building blocks and configurable workflows. Compare individual and business onboarding, review and data handling with the needs of your users. A successful identity check does not establish wallet ownership or clear every future transaction.','Test legitimate-user completion, manual-review handoff, device accessibility, business-owner checks and exports of the decision history.','https://withpersona.com/'],
 ['arkham-intelligence','Arkham Intelligence','analytics','Arkham provides on-chain analytics and entity-attribution tools. Use attribution as an investigative lead with supporting evidence, not conclusive legal proof of beneficial ownership or misconduct. Public intelligence and a production compliance monitoring integration have different requirements.','Ask how a label was established, when it changed, how it can be challenged and which monitoring, export or API functions the selected product supplies.','https://arkm.com/']
